In the second experiment, participants were sitting on a rotated seat, facing against the driving direction. Vehicle manufacturers (e.g., the Mercedes Benz F015 concept car) have already presented similar concepts. To communicate system decisions, participants were presented upcoming maneuvers on a head mounted display (Microsoft HoloLens) that could be substituted in the future by enhanced AR glasses or contact lenses.
